  snippet?: string(name='snippet', description='The summary.', example='During the 2025 Shanghai Auto Show, the AITO brand was undoubtedly the most popular, becoming the center of attention for many industry leaders. Zhang Xinghai, Chairman and Founder of SERES Group, Yu Chengdong, Managing Director of Huawei and Chairman of Terminal BG, Chen Daoming, a famous actor, and Zeng Yuqun, Chairman of CATL, all shared their experiences using AITO. ..'),
  summary?: string(name='summary', description='The enhanced summary, 400 words or more.', example='During the 2025 Shanghai Auto Show, the AITO brand was undoubtedly the most popular, becoming the center of attention for many industry leaders. Zhang Xinghai, Chairman and Founder of SERES Group, Yu Chengdong, Managing Director of Huawei and Chairman of Terminal BG, Chen Daoming, a famous actor, and Zeng Yuqun, Chairman of CATL, all shared their experiences using AITO. "I am an AITO M9 user, and the driving experience is excellent," Chen Daoming said, adding that he only dared to recommend it on the spot after experiencing it himself. In the future, he hopes to achieve special customization of the AITO M9, making the exterior, interior, and seat layout more in line with his own needs. It is reported that the 2025 AITO M9 delivered over 10,000 units within 25 days of its launch, and has been the sales champion of 500,000 RMB luxury cars for 11 consecutive months; the AITO M8 received over 50,000 firm orders within 4 days of its launch, and is deeply loved by the market and users... "AITO M9 and M8 are reshaping the landscape of China\\\\"s luxury car market," Zhang Xinghai said. He recently test-drove the AITO M8 to the limit, departing from Chongqing and arriving at Mount Kailash after 55 hours and over 3,500 kilometers. Throughout the journey, the safety and experience of the vehicle performed excellently'),
